action.$comment:
An action object assigned to an event prop (e.g. onClick, onChange).

Supported actions:
  state.set        — sets a local state key.
    { action: 'state.set', target: '<stateName>', value: <any> }

  navigation.open  — navigates to a named route.
    { action: 'navigation.open', name: '<routeName>',
      type: 'push'|'replace'|'sheet'|'dialog' }

  navigation.back  — goes back to previous route.
    { action: 'navigation.back' }

  navigation.close — closes the current overlay/sheet/dialog.
    { action: 'navigation.close' }
